{"hw":"πῶλος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πῶλος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πῶλος</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span> and <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">foal</b>, whether <b class=\"lex-tr\">colt</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">filly</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20.222</span> </span> (fem.), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">23.246</span> </span> (masc.); <span class=\"gk\">ἵππους.. πάσας θηλείας, πολλῇσι δὲ πῶλοι ὑπῆσαν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.681</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐδάμασσε πώλους</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">P.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.8</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">νεοζυγὴς π</span>. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1010</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">κριθῶντα π</span>. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ag.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1641</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὁ ἔτι ἀδάμαστος π</span>. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eq.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.1</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἵπποι π</span>., opp. <span class=\"gk\">ἵπποι τέλειοι</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9(1).12.18</span> </span> (Ambryssus, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">iii A.D.</span>): freq. used by Poets generally for <span class=\"gk\">ἵππος</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <sp